{"id": "DecMXypvoMF", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CODING\" to start Reverse Engineering things with Claude Code. \n\nYour Claude Code can now reverse engineer any app on your computer.\n\nDown to its every feature, for completely free.\n\nIt's called Reverse Engineer Anything.\n\nIt's a free and open source tool that's just crossed 37,000 stars on GitHub.\n\nYou just install it and point it at any desktop app, mobile app, or website.\n\nAnd it decompiles the whole thing.\n\nIt pulls out its full code.\n\nAnd then traces back how each feature works.\n\nAll the way from your click to the final output.\n\nAnd it explains it to you step by step.\n\nPlus it also helps you rebuild that same feature for your own product.\n\nBased on your coding stack.\n\nThink of it like getting the blueprints to a finished building instead of just walking through the front door.\n\nYou see exactly how every part was put together.\n\nNothing stays hidden.\n\nNo more guessing how your favorite app pulls off that one feature.\n\nInstead of starting from a blank page, you start from something that already works.\n\nThat saves you hours of trial and error on every new feature.\n\nIt works on desktop apps, mobile apps, and websites alike.\n\n#claudecode #githubrepo #rea #reverseengineeranything #opensourceai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791907553, "like_count": 2599, "comment_count": 2919, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2223266741877030a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.627, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPmmSzZrJFh9XuRp8b3Aq7y7lYYCpZuF1NJ7ZrVN-e5NuCmwiMvFuY28vjkYvFc6DXu4IGh4DmG6218XGVVcxwK6Ns3WC6SGGrslOs.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpjQeBFkflyxLw4Z4PEgIHoeKIZSp-NDvH8wR87XoW_henw331fq03DaWfzWoQHT0o&_nc_sid=